# nexora-action-code: get_memory
Value MEMORY_CLASS (Mem)
Value TOTAL_KB (\d+)
Value USED_KB (\d+)
Value FREE_KB (\d+)
Value SHARED_KB (\d+|--)
Value BUFFERS_KB (\d+|--)
Value CACHED_KB (\d+|--)
Value FREE_RATIO (\d+(?:\.\d+)?%)

Start
  ^Memory\s+statistics\s+are\s+measured\s+in\s+KB:\s*$$
  ^\s*Total\s+Used\s+Free\s+Shared\s+Buffers\s+Cached\s+FreeRatio\s*$$
  ^${MEMORY_CLASS}:\s+${TOTAL_KB}\s+${USED_KB}\s+${FREE_KB}\s+${SHARED_KB}\s+${BUFFERS_KB}\s+${CACHED_KB}\s+${FREE_RATIO}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^-/\+\s+Buffers/Cache:.*$$
  ^Swap:.*$$
  ^LowMem:.*$$
  ^\s*$$
